func ProvisionQueues(ctx context.Context, db *sql.DB, outboxCapacity, inboxCapacity int, action string) error
    ProvisionQueues runs the deployment-only permit provisioning on the
    migration connection after CapacityMigrations were applied. action "install"
    refuses an already provisioned queue; "resize" is the idempotent deployment
    entry and creates the permit pool on first use. Both queues are provisioned
    in ONE transaction under queue and permit table locks, adopt existing rows
    transactionally, refuse targets below live rows, and roll back completely so
    both queues stay consistent on any failure. Call it from deployment with the
    configured capacities, never on request paths.


